{
  "id": "21621_sanpusuru",
  "headword": "{散布|さんぷ}する",
  "reading": "さんぷする",
  "romaji": "sanpusuru",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "to scatter; to spray; to spread",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to scatter; to spray; to spread over an area",
      "explanation": "To distribute something over a wide area, especially liquids or powders such as pesticides, fertilizer, or water."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "21621_sanpusuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{農薬|のうやく}を{散布|さんぷ}する。",
      "english": "To spray pesticide.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21621_sanpusuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{庭|にわ}に{除草剤|じょそうざい}を{散布|さんぷ}した。",
      "english": "I sprayed herbicide in the garden.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21621_sanpusuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "ヘリコプターで{広|ひろ}い{範囲|はんい}に{薬剤|やくざい}を{散布|さんぷ}した。",
      "english": "They sprayed chemicals over a wide area by helicopter.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Primarily used in agricultural, environmental, and public health contexts for distributing substances over an area.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {農薬|のうやく}{散布|さんぷ}: pesticide spraying\n- {除草剤|じょそうざい}を{散布|さんぷ}: to spray herbicide\n- {肥料|ひりょう}を{散布|さんぷ}: to spread fertilizer\n- {空中|くうちゅう}{散布|さんぷ}: aerial spraying\n- ビラを{散布|さんぷ}する: to distribute flyers/leaflets\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {撒|ま}く: to scatter, to sprinkle — everyday word, more general\n- {噴霧|ふんむ}する: to atomize, to mist — finer spray\n- {散|ち}らす: to scatter — more general, also used for non-liquid things\n\nFORMS:\n{散|さん} (scatter) + {布|ぷ} (spread). The {布|ぷ} element implies spreading over a surface area.",
